The Software and all intellectual property rights therein remain the exclusive property of VerdantStack. This Agreement does not transfer ownership of the Software to you.

6. UPDATES

Your license includes updates for the life of the product.

  - Updates include bug fixes, security patches, and minor improvements
  - Major version upgrades are included at no additional cost. You are never
required to repurchase the Software to receive a version you already paid
for, and no major-version release will be withheld as a separate sale.
  - "For the life of the product" means for as long as VerdantStack continues to
publish the Software. It does not oblige either party to keep publishing
indefinitely; see Section 8.

> Changed in 1.4. Version 1.3 read "Major version upgrades may require
> separate purchase", which contradicted the lifetime promise above and the
> marketing. That clause is removed. Buyers on 1.3 receive the terms of the
> version in force at purchase for the grants above.

