8. UPDATES & SUPPORT (LIFETIME)

Your one-time license includes lifetime updates to the Software as defined in Section 6 and lifetime standard support via email to VerdantStack (verdantstack@proton.me) at the address in Section 14, with a target response time of 48 hours (async only). This applies, subject to the following terms, for the life of the product while your license is active and in good standing.

Included:
  - Installation assistance
  - Bug reports and fixes for the Software
  - Usage questions about the Software itself
  - Lifetime updates as defined in Section 6

Not included:
  - Custom development, consulting, or implementation services
  - Support for modifications you make to the code
  - Support for a different VerdantStack product — each kit is a separate product requiring its own license
  - Guaranteed availability of specific features, timelines, or roadmap items

VerdantStack will make commercially reasonable efforts to maintain and improve the Software but makes no binding commitment regarding the scope, frequency, or nature of updates.

Support is provided while your license is active and in good standing; revoked or refunded licenses lose support and download access.

